  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help 100 Female Entrepreneurs from Rio de Janeiro</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The work that www.asplande.org.br has been developing since 1992 has already impacted the lives of about 10,000 women entrepreneurs. We support female entrepreneurship through courses, individual and collective mentoring and networking among entrepreneurs. The main objective of this project is to continue to help these women in the ASPLANDE&apos;s program &quot;Mulheres em Rede Compartilhando Saberes&quot; (Women in Network Sharing Knowledge), we hope to support the enterprise of about 100 women in 2023.</narrative>
  </description>
